'''Mob Cat''' (極道にゃんこ, Gokudō Nyanko) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Yakuza Apocalypse Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mob Cat
|image = E 161.png
|appearance = [[Yakuza Apocalypse Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 150円 - 592円
}}

==Enemy==
Mob Cat is essentially a Traitless version of [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]], except it trades speed for extra health and range. The lower speed and Single Attack means it is less of a threat, and the higher range is barely relevant.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] along with meatshields. Other units that can outrange it also work well, like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]]. Tanky units with decent attack power like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] or its [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|crazed]] counterpart can also kill it easily.

